naming convention ke according same cache key construct karti hain:

    product:101


Teeno instances pehle Redis Cache me is key ko check karti hain.

Lekin teeno ko data Cache me available nahi milta.

Yaani:

    Cache Miss


Ab teeno instances isi cache entry ke corresponding lock acquire
karne ke liye application me defined naming convention ke according
lock key derive karti hain:

    Cache Key → product:101
            |
            v
    Lock Key  → lock:product:101


Ab teeno instances same lock key ke liye Redis me lock acquire
karne ki koshish karti hain:

    SET lock:product:101 <owner-id> NX EX 10


### QUESTION: IS COMMAND KA MATLAB KYA HAI?
---------------------------------------------

SET lock:product:101 <unique-owner-id> NX EX 10


