Redis ka NX ensure karta hai ki:

Key sirf tab create hogi jab woh pehle se exist nahi karti.

Initially:

lock:refresh:product:101

key Redis me exist nahi karti.

Ab suppose R357 ki request Redis tak sabse pehle successfully pahunchti hai.

R357 execute karti hai:

