Kyunki ye different keys hain, Redis Cluster me ye different Hash Slots
aur potentially different Redis Nodes par distribute ho sakti hain.

Isse Hot Key ke read traffic ko multiple cache copies aur potentially
multiple Redis Nodes ke across distribute kiya ja sakta hai.



